libuv
-----
https://github.com/libuv/libuv
Location: vendor/libuv (git submodule, pinned)
Used: linked by the C shim. The build uses a system libuv when pkg-config
finds one at version 1.48.0 or later; otherwise it builds this copy as a
shared library and links the shim against it. A distribution that ships
that library ships libuv, and must carry its notices.

