chez-srfi
---------
https://github.com/arcfide/chez-srfi
Location: vendor/chez-srfi (git submodule, pinned; also named in Akku.lock)
Used: by the test suites only, for SRFI 64 and the SRFIs it imports. The
library itself, (libuv), imports nothing from it, and Akku.manifest lists
it as a development dependency, which a project that depends on
chez-libuv does not install.

